<title>POLAND: SPEED SKATING-SINGLE DISTANCE WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SPEED SKATING-SINGLE DISTANCE WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the third day of the</p>
<p>world single distance speed skating championships on Sunday:</p>
<p>Men's 1,000 metres</p>
<p>  1. Adne Sondral (Norway)		   1 minute 14.40 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Jan Bos (Netherlands)			    1:14.81</p>
<p>  3. Martin Hersman (Netherlands)		   1:15.07</p>
<p>  4. Jeremy Wotherspoon (Canada)		    1:15.33</p>
